OL,3,AMariah Carey set to headline 2027 music
OL,4,Afestival
OL,5,
OL,6,FBest-selling female solo artist Mariah
OL,7,FCarey has been announced as the third
OL,8,Fheadliner for a music festival.
OL,10,FLive at Powderham organisers said the
OL,11,Fsinger would bring her Firefly summer
OL,12,Ftour to Powderham Castle in Devon on 27
OL,13,FJune 2027, alongside special guests
OL,14,FSugababes, with additional support from
OL,15,FR&B group Eternal.
OL,17,FThe All I Want For Christmas Is You and
OL,18,FLove Takes Time singer has amassed more
OL,19,Fthan 19 Billboard Hot 100 Number One
OL,20,Fsingles ` more than any solo artist in
OL,21,Fhistory.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
