OL,3,AMariah Carey set to headline 2027 music
OL,4,Afestival
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe is due to be headlining the
OL,7,Ffestival near Exeter alongside Shania
OL,8,FTwain, who has been set to perform on
OL,9,F24 June 2027; and Alex Warren,
OL,10,Fperforming on 26 June.
